+//
+// renderAllClientsForWorkspace(translate, scale) emits ONE renderModif hint at the very start,
+// and that hint applies to everything drawn afterwards: the wallpaper, the BACKGROUND/BOTTOM
+// layers (noctalia), the windows, and (until it is reset) the TOP/OVERLAY layers too. Passing the
+// canvas transform through it therefore shrinks the whole desktop, not only the windows.
